PORTED FROM BLENDER

Some behaviour in Husk is ported from Blender (https://www.blender.org),
Copyright Blender Authors, licensed under GPL-2.0-or-later. Each ported piece
is marked in its source file:

husk_core/src/render/renderer.rs
  pan_offset: from viewmove_apply (view3d_navigate.cc), ED_view3d_win_to_delta
    (view3d_project.cc) and ED_view3d_calc_zfac.
  orthographic_after_rotating: from ED_view3d_persp_ensure (view3d_utils.cc).
  radius_to_dist: from ED_view3d_radius_to_dist (view3d_utils.cc).
  frame_bounds: from view3d_from_minmax (view3d_navigate_view_all.cc).
  The test that checks the six standard views uses the rotations from
      view3d_quat_axis (view3d_utils.cc).

husk_core/src/scene/mode.rs
  ObjectMode: from eObjectMode (DNA_object_enums.h).
  mode_compat_test: from mode_compat_test (object_modes.cc).
  set: from the checks in mode_set_ex and mode_compat_set (object_modes.cc).


